# Boxing Gym CRM UI

One task lives in one place. Put it on Home or on the record that staff already open. Do not add a second entry point, a new app, or a new page type for the same task.

```text
Refund stays on the Merchandise Sale record.
It does not also appear as a Home card.
```

Use Salesforce Lightning Design System components (`lightning-card`, `lightning-button`, `lightning-input`, `lightning-record-form`). Do not invent a custom visual style with raw HTML and CSS.

Consider desktop and phone. The Home override exists for large screens only. A new screen sets both form factors, or names which one it cannot support.

Do not add a color or a font. The app brand is the existing header color `#000000` in `Boxing_Gym_CRM.app-meta.xml`. Use SLDS styling hooks that are already in the component. Do not set a new `headerColor`, `background-color`, or `font-family`.
